{
  "fixtureId": "go-json-v1-rich",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "producer": "backend/internal/features/jobs/application/draftjson",
  "notes": [
    "Whole private vacancy draft envelopes {schema_version,document} for the rich fixture; all 16 cases are positive.",
    "Literal expectedUtf8 authored before comparison against EncodeValidatedValue; expectedHex, expectedByteLength and expectedSha256 are derived from that authored expectedUtf8 and are never regenerated from encoder output.",
    "The document shape is intended to be rich-draft grammar-valid only. This package never executes a rich grammar, decodes no raw JSON, validates no request budget and computes no DTO fingerprint, so the Go tests prove byte encoding only.",
    "Integer fixture inputs are decoded with json.Decoder.UseNumber and converted through a bounded strconv.ParseInt (base 10, bitSize 64); the loader never produces a float64.",
    "Presence and order pairs are intentional: paragraph content omitted versus [], text marks omitted versus [], bold-then-italic versus italic-then-bold, NFC U+00E9 versus decomposed e+U+0301, real U+2028/U+2029 versus literal backslash escape text.",
    "This file is intentionally pure ASCII (non-ASCII content is written as JSON backslash-uXXXX escapes) so the expected bytes are pinned by expectedHex."
  ],
  "cases": [
